<<<
The en-tout-cas has been taken in:—JI warned him when he spoke to me that I could not speak to him at all if I was to be quoted as an authority; he seemed to have taken this as applying only to the first question he asked me (seems to have).
===
The *en-tout-cas* has been taken in:—*I warned him when he spoke to me that I could not speak to him at all if I was to be quoted as an authority;* he seemed to have taken *this as applying only to the first question he asked me* (seems to have).
>>>

